abstract: >-
  Canonical, de-duplicated and fully indexed registry of every Ionity Global /
  AEDI brand, product, media, document and web asset, including generated
  derivative size ladders, favicon and PWA sets, platform social scopes, design
  tokens, ANSI/ASCII brand art, XMP provenance sidecars and a machine-readable
  asset registry. Governed by Policy 986 AED.
